# Map layout rules

When building / changing map generation in `game.js`:

1. Player can reach every walkable spot (flood-fill connectivity).
2. Each wall run is at least **2 adjacent blocks** — no single gaps bullets can sneak through.
3. Equal number of **vertical** and **horizontal** wall runs (2+2 is OK).
4. Place decorations / props only **after** walls already satisfy 1–3; never let props seal a region.

Walls regenerate on each new game (`generateWalls`).
